SUMMARY:[Machine Learning][Reinforcement Learning] AAMAS 2027 - Main-track 
 abstract registration deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on Autonomous Agents
  and Multiagent Systems\nWebsite: https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas
 2027/\nSource URL: https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas2027/calls/call
 -for-main-track/\nLocation: Hanoi\, Vietnam\nTopics: Machine Learning\, R
 einforcement Learning\, Control & Robotics\, Human-AI Interaction & Deplo
 yment\nSize: XL\nSubmission type: Paper-based / Blue Sky Ideas short pape
 rs\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Annual f
 lagship meeting in Hanoi. New main-track submissions are closed because t
 he Oct 1 abstract gate has passed\, even before the Oct 8 paper cutoff. T
 he separate four-page Blue Sky Ideas track remains a forthcoming opportun
 ity\; author registration is announced for Oct 20 but no exact opening ho
 ur is given. Its Nov 5 gate only controls its Nov 12 short papers. AAAI f
 ast-track and already published JAAMAS presentations are not general new-
 paper routes. Size XL is an editorial estimate. Historical acceptance cov
 ers main full papers only\, not Blue Sky Ideas or the newly introduced 20
 27 Findings track.\nScope: Autonomous agents and multi-agent systems: lea
 rning and adaptation\, coordination\, game theory\, planning\, reasoning\
 , agent engineering\, and agent-based simulation. Also covers human-agent
  interaction\, robot teams\, norms and governance\, and generative agents
 . The contribution should concern agents or their interaction\; generic l
 anguage-model or learning results are not automatically in scope.\nAdditi
 onal topics: Deep Representation Learning\, Probabilistic\, Causal & Unce
 rtainty ML\, Evolutionary Computation & Optimization\, Complex Systems & 
 Network Science\, Ethics & Governance\, Explainability & Interpretability
 \nScope sources (2027): https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas2027/calls
 /call-for-main-track/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas2027/calls/call-for-main-track/
END:VEVENT
